SYNTHESIS
  The generated-word frontier has no q0 failures in this scout: every
  sparse-coordinate challenger that survives in the arbitrary cone is
  beaten after actual coherent miss-zeta contexts are applied.
  The normalized generated atom moves stay visibly far from the cheap
  abstract LP directions: low factorial leakage is never near zero, so
  the low observers are not silently preserved.  This supports the
  HYP-2721 guardrail: abstract q0-hiding moves must be checked against
  generated product words before they are treated as real LRC packets.
